### Booking Service - REST Client test file

@base = http://localhost:3002
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
@bookingId = REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID

### Create a new booking
### NOTE: the ride_ready event fires 3 minutes after this - check inbox then.
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "startLocation": "Valletta, Malta",
  "endLocation": "Sliema, Malta",
  "dateTime": "2026-05-10T14:00:00.000Z",
  "passengers": 2,
  "cabType": "Premium"
}

###

### Get current (upcoming) bookings for a user
GET {{base}}/bookings/user/{{userId}}/current

###

### Get past (completed) bookings for a user
GET {{base}}/bookings/user/{{userId}}/past

###

### Get a single booking by ID
GET {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}

###

### Manually mark a booking as completed (internal use)
PATCH {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/complete
